    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Could you go into a bit more detail on the specific chemical mechanisms here? Like, why exactly does the solubility of those micronutrients change as the pH shifts towards the more alkaline side of that 7.0 range?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
